# Row I5.4: the debrief (decisions 4, 14, 15). The recruiter and the hiring manager of an opening the candidate applied to read
# it (their applications only); an interviewer is not found whatever they have submitted; another opening's hiring manager is not found.
GET /api/interviews/candidates/{candidates.ingrid}/debrief | interviewer interviewer2 workOnly=403 anon=403 guest=403 | recruiter hiringManager
GET /api/interviews/candidates/{candidates.mateo}/debrief | interviewer interviewer2 workOnly=403 anon=403 guest=403 | recruiter hiringManager
GET /api/interviews/candidates/{candidates.jonah}/debrief | interviewer interviewer2 workOnly=403 anon=403 guest=403 | recruiter hiringManager
# Ravi applied to iOS: the Backend and Engineering Manager hiring manager does not see this application at all.
GET /api/interviews/candidates/{candidates.ravi}/debrief | hiringManager interviewer interviewer2 workOnly=403 anon=403 guest=403 | recruiter
GET /api/interviews/candidates/cand-nonexistent/debrief | recruiter hiringManager interviewer interviewer2
